+# Why CVE-2026-0775 Is a False Positive for `npm` cli and Requires No Patching
+
+This document explains why **CVE-2026-0775** is a **false positive** when reported against **npm cli**, and confirms that the vulnerability **does not originate** in npm cli's own code, making any direct patching or backporting of npm itself unnecessary.
+
+---
+
